                                                "sense_id": "389c4844-af7f-3db8-93e2-f7c1243591ae",
                                                "text": "“Welllllllllllll, maybe a little mouth-to mouth^([sic]) is in order,” as she flung her arms around Quirk's neck, pressed her firm, yet supple body against his and gave him a long, open mouthed kiss."
